==Description==
The '''Cold Front Crate''' is a crate purchasable for {{Coins|3,000}}. This crate yields six Arctic-themed skins. Skins from this crate can appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Cold Front Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|3,000}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|3,500}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|4,250}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|6,000}}.

The '''Cold Front Crate''' is a metal camo crate with a keypad, which is used to open it.

