==Trivia==
*When first released, this crate was stated to be a seasonal crate, meaning that it would be taken offsale at some point. Despite this, the crate never went offsale, even after winter ended.
*The crate is opened by entering the code "''1337''" into the keypad, which is a reference to [[wp:Leet|leetspeak]].
*All the skins in this crate were made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/47939131/profile MidnightKrystal].

